  "content": "\n\n<h5><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/826840/description_adb231dd-183f-4057-98fd-08c40c199cb6.png\"></h5>\n<h5><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/Yh9O6WH.png\"></h5>\n<h5>⚔️&nbsp;<strong>全面优化，支持光影</strong></h5>\n<h5>⚔️ <strong>全新重构的精美世界生成（<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/oh-the-biomes-weve-gone\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Oh the Biomes We've Gone</a>）</strong></h5>\n<h5><strong>⚔️ 数千个全新地牢与建筑（<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/when-dungeons-arise-fabric\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">When Dungeons Arise</a>、<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/lukis-grand-capitals\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Capital Cities</a>、全新<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/dnt-end-castle-standalone\" rel=\"nofollow\">酒馆与试炼地牢</a>）</strong></h5>\n<h5><strong>⚔️ 建立你自己的王国（<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/minecolonies\" rel=\"nofollow\">MineColonies</a>、<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/stylecolonies\" rel=\"nofollow\">StyleColonies</a>）</strong></h5>\n<h5><strong>⚔️ 成为强大的法师（<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/irons-spells-n-spellbooks\" rel=\"nofollow\">Iron's Spells 'n Spellbooks</a>、<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/ars-nouveau\" rel=\"nofollow\">Ars Nouveau</a>）</strong></h5>\n<h5><strong>⚔️ 重构要塞与堡垒</strong></h5>\n<h5><strong>⚔️ 50+ 任务引导你前行！</strong></h5>\n<h5>⚔️ <strong>提升游戏体验的功能，如 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/fabric-waystones\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Waystones</a> 和 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/journeymap\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">JourneyMap</a></strong></h5>\n<h5><strong>⚔️ 沉浸式的中世纪 RPG 体验</strong></h5>\n<h5><strong>⚔️ 250+ 模组；深度定制以实现模组集成与兼容</strong></h5>\n<p><strong><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.bisecthosting.com%252fp%252flunapixel\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/discord/790272037578473512?label=Discord&color=393939&labelColor=0843bf&style=for-the-badge&logo=discord&logoColor=white\" width=\"235\" height=\"32\"></a></strong></p>\n<h5 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><strong>非官方 Minecraft 产品。未经 Mojang 或微软批准或认可。</strong></span></h5>",
